{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1500 \u00een trun\u021ba din flandra. Cuptorul de p\u00e2ine Cald, iar buc\u0103teria miroasea secar\u0103 \u0219i afum. \u0218tiai ca ii ce \u00eenp\u00e2n\u0103 la 4 zile din zice, e interzit s\u0103 man\u0103\u0219care, vinerea, postumare, postu cr\u0103ciunului, biserica le spune zile de post. 8 ceaim farfurie, p\u00e2inea proape la fiecare mas\u0103. Terci maz\u0103re \u0219i fasole, bere de b\u0103ut, pe\u0219te uscat \u00een zilele de post. Cea mai mare parte din ce cheltu e familia ta se duce pe m\u00e2ncare? 7 zice p\u00e2n\u0103 la 80 la suta. C\u00e2nd recolta nu e se, p\u00e2inea se scum pe\u0219te brusc, iar oamenii fl\u0103m\u00e2nt zesc. C\u00e2t treie\u0219ti, \u00een anglie chiar pe este mare un nou n\u0103scut puteasperal avr\u0103 30 \u0219i 5 de ani. Mai ales pentru c\u0103 mureau foarte m\u00e2nscopii. Dac\u0103 apucai 30 de ani, aveai \u015fan se destul de bune s\u0103 ajungi la 60. Deci ce e m\u00e2ncarea pentru tine? Combustibil. C\u00e2t s\u0103 supravie\u021bi o e\u0219ti ziua. Sine minte zilele de post. Revin la final. Iar pe mare \u00een cele mai lunge c\u0103l\u0103tori, marinari \u00eencep s\u0103 se destrame.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.72, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1500 \u00een trun\u021ba din flandra.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 15351, 364, 425, 2119, 628, 15351, 504, 409, 15918, 64, 3791, 932, 474, 424, 13, 50569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.4937549114227295, "compression_ratio": 1.435483870967742, "no_speech_prob": 0.05250167474150658, "words": [{"word": " Te", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2, "probability": 0.3506876528263092}, {"word": " treze\u0219ti", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.72, "probability": 0.7985841035842896}, {"word": " \u00een", "start": 0.72, "end": 0.88, "probability": 0.4848559498786926}, {"word": " anul", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.16, "probability": 0.9218991994857788}, {"word": " 1500", "start": 1.16, "end": 